{"title":"正式发布《必须招标的工程项目规定》","date":"2018-04-03","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体\">正式发布《必须招标的工程项目规定》</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">经国务院批复（国函〔</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">2018</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">〕</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">56</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">号），近日，国家发展改革委员会通过官网正式发布《必须招标的工程项目规定》，新《规定》与</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">2000</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">日国务院批准、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">2000</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">年</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">5</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">月</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62); font-size: 14pt;\">日原国家发展计划委员会发布的《工程建设项目招标范围和规模标准规定》相比，必须招标的项目金额大幅提高。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(89, 195, 249)\">\r\n\t<section style=\"margin-top:20px\">\r\n\t\t<section data-width=\"95%\" style=\"width:95%;margin:0 auto\">\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%;display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;-webkit-box-pack:center;-webkit-justify-content:center;-ms-flex-pack:center;justify-content:center;-webkit-box-align:end;-webkit-align-items:flex-end;-ms-flex-align:end;align-items:flex-end\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 0px; height: 0px; border-width: 0px 10px 20px 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: transparent #59c3f9 transparent transparent; border-image: initial;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"50%\" style=\"width: 50%; height: 40px; display: flex; -webkit-box-pack: center; justify-content: center; -webkit-box-align: center; align-items: center; background-color: #59c3f9; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; font-size: 18px; min-width: 1px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">主要变化如下</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:50%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; border: 1px solid #59c3f9; box-sizing: border-box; padding-top: 30px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; margin-top: -20px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 1.6; color: rgb(89, 195, 249); min-width: 1px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 18px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">（一）施工单项合同估算价由<strong>200万提高到<span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">4</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\">0</span>0万；</strong></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 18px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">（二）重要设备、材料等货物的采购，单项合同估算价由100万提高到<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1px;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 0px;\">0</span>0万；</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 18px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">（三<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: -4px;\">）</span>勘察<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: -4px;\">、</span>设计<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: -4px;\">、</span>监理等服务的采购<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: -4px;\">，</span>单项合同估算价由50万提高到<span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1px;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 0px;\">0</span>0万。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 18px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun;\">（四）取消&ldquo;单项合同估算价低于第（一）、（二）、（三）项规定的标准，但项目总投资额在3000万元人民币以上&rdquo;的规定。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width:100%;display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;-webkit-box-pack:justify;-webkit-justify-content:space-between;-ms-flex-pack:justify;justify-content:space-between\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-width=\"50%\" style=\"line-height: 1.6; width: 50%; color: rgb(89, 195, 249); min-width: 1px; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201804/%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E6%8B%9B%E6%A0%87%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E7%89%88.jpg\" style=\"width: 980px; height: 430px;\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<section class=\"_editor\" data-color=\"rgb(216, 40, 33)\">\r\n\t<section>\r\n\t\t<section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin-left: 15px; border-left: 1px solid #d82821;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding-bottom:10px;box-bozing:border-box;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width: 5px; height: 40px; background-color: #d82821; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; border-radius: 10px; margin-left: 5px; color: #ffffff;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:5px;padding:0px 10px 2px 0px;box-bozing:border-box;line-height:23px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-size:18px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>​发改委文件全文</b></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t</section>\r\n</section>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\">必<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\">须</span>招标<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\">的</span>工程<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.15pt\">项</span>目规定</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E\">第一条<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">为了确定必须招标的工程项目，规范招标投标活动，提高工作效率<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">、</span>降低企业成本<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.4pt\">、</span>预防腐败<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.4pt\">，</span>根<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\">据</span>《中华人民共和国招标投标法》第三条的规定，制定本规定。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E\">第二条<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;\r\nletter-spacing:.45pt\">全</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.6pt\">部</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.45pt\">或</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;\r\nletter-spacing:.6pt\">者</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.45pt\">部分</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.6pt\">使</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;\r\nletter-spacing:.45pt\">用</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.6pt\">国</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.45pt\">有资</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;\r\nletter-spacing:.6pt\">金</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.45pt\">投资</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.6pt\">或</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;\r\nletter-spacing:.45pt\">者</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.6pt\">国</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.45pt\">家融</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E;\r\nletter-spacing:.6pt\">资</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;color:#3E3E3E;letter-spacing:.45pt\">的</span><span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">项目包括：</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:\r\n14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">（一<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.6pt\">）</span>使用预算资金<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n.55pt\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">0</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span>万元人民币以上<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">，</span>并且该资金占投资额<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\">1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">0</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n-.15pt\">%</span>以上的项目；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">（二<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.6pt\">）</span>使用国有企业事业单位资金<span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n-.1pt\">，</span>并且该资金占控股或者主导地位的项目。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E\">第三条<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">使用国际组织或者外国政府贷款<span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.5pt\">、</span>援助资金的项目包括：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">（一<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.4pt\">）</span>使用世界银行<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">、</span>亚洲开发银行等国际组织贷款<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">、</span>援助资金的项目；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">（二）使用外国政府及其机构贷款、援助资金的项目。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E\">第四条<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">不属于本规定第二条<span style=\"letter-spacing:-1.5pt\">、</span>第三条规定情形的大型基础设施<span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n-.4pt\">、</span>公用事业等关系社会公共利益<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">、</span>公众安全的项目<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">，</span>必须招标的<span style=\"letter-spacing:.45pt\">具体</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\">范</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.45pt\">围由国</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\">务</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.45pt\">院发展</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\">改</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.45pt\">革部门会</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\">同</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.45pt\">国务院</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\">有</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.45pt\">关部门按</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.6pt\">照</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.45pt\">确有</span>必要、严格限定的原则制订，报国务院批准。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E\">第五条<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">本规定第二条至第四条规定范围内的项目，其勘察、设计<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.4pt\">、</span>施工<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">、</span>监理以及与工程建设有关的重要设备<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">、</span>材料等的采购达到下列标准之一的，必须招标：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">（一）施工单项合同估算价在<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\">4</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">0</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span>万元人民币以上；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">（二）重要设备、材料等货物的采购，单项合同估算价在<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">0</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span>万元人民币以上；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">（三<span style=\"letter-spacing:-3.0pt\">）</span>勘察<span style=\"letter-spacing:-3.0pt\">、</span>设计<span style=\"letter-spacing:-3.0pt\">、</span>监理等服务的采购<span style=\"letter-spacing:-3.0pt\">，</span>单项合同估算价在<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\">1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">0</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span>万元人民币以上。同一项目中可以合并进行的勘察<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.4pt\">、</span>设计<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">、</span>施工<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.55pt\">、</span>监理以及与工程建设有关的重要设备<span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n-.6pt\">、</span>材料等的采购<span style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">，</span>合同估算价合计达到前款规定标准的，必须招标。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;\r\ncolor:#3E3E3E\">第六条<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#3E3E3E\">本规定自<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:.55pt\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\">0</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n.55pt\">1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>日起施行。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}